{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38840","headline":"御沟柳 · 杜荀鹤","name":"御沟柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"律到御沟春，沟边柳色新。\n细笼穿禁水，轻拂入朝人。\n日近韶光早，天低圣泽匀。\n谷莺栖未稳，宫女画难真。\n楚国空摇浪，隋堤暗惹尘。\n如何帝城里，先得覆龙津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38840.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38840","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}